Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.34,0:00:03.48,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,The blight... has manifested.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:08.48,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.12,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,That's a Fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:14.59,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,A Fiend?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:23.50,Sign_Basic,series title,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\bord1\shad.5\b1\c&HFAFDFE&\3c&H3D6671&\4c&H372771&\pos(95,315)}The Warrior Princess and the Barbaric King
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:21.00,Main - Top,Malcius,0,0,0,,No! No, no! Release me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:25.34,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.77,0:00:30.50,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera, we cut through it and the woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:32.77,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It'll drink her soul dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:35.76,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,If we act now, she can die \Nwith her humanity intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.63,0:00:43.02,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Don't look at me!\NO Lord, please, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:45.43,Main,Radil,0,0,0,,Retinue Priest Malcius!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.43,0:00:46.40,Main,Alex,0,0,0,,Damned monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:04.39,Main,Radil,0,0,0,,Aleks?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:12.36,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Malcius!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:34.52,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,No! Get out of my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:39.28,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's begun to feast! Warriors, with—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:40.22,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Veor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:43.66,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,The others have no obligation to save her,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.66,0:01:46.91,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,but two have already \Ndied while I stood back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:52.92,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Anyone... save me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:55.37,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,No more casualties!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.37,0:01:58.19,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,By my pride as a knight commander, I will \Nnot let the people of my homeland...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:02:01.30,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,No! I will not let the helpless \Ndie when they're within my reach!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.19,0:02:05.63,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,With enough willpower, \NI can cut through it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:13.02,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Not enough to critically wound it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.15,0:02:18.33,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Release me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.61,0:02:29.01,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Sera?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:31.71,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Y-Your Thundering Voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:34.38,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Still, don't try to stop me, Veor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:35.85,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.18,0:02:37.81,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,We'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.15,0:02:40.11,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.11,0:02:42.12,Main,Sero,0,0,0,,You're willing to risk your life for hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:43.26,Main,Sero,0,0,0,,How can we ignore that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:51.39,Main,Sero,0,0,0,,Not after you risked that same \Nlife to save my sister and nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.18,0:02:58.86,Main,Gamelan,0,0,0,,You earned this debt with your life. \NWe're gonna pay it back, just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:01.86,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Let us honor the risk you took.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:06.87,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.47,0:03:15.77,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Do you have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.77,0:03:17.27,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,When I used my Thundering Voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.27,0:03:19.71,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I saw what I believe to be \Nthe core of the blight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:23.81,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,The warriors will occupy its \Ntentacles, acting as a distraction,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:26.88,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,while I will expose the core \Nagain with my Thundering Voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:30.52,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Understood. Then I'm to destroy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:32.31,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Can I entrust you with the task?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.57,0:03:34.06,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:35.40,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:36.32,Main,All,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:04.89,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Pierce it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.67,0:04:21.45,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,That's beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.41,0:04:25.62,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,We did it—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:31.29,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.87,0:04:38.17,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,My head hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.45,0:04:41.01,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,I feel like I had an awful dream—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:45.97,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Wh-What in the world is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:50.91,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,M-My scripture and relics are g-gone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:53.73,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?! O Lord, what do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:02.94,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,B-Barbarian!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:05.38,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,I'm going to be violated, \Npassed around, and then murdered!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:07.91,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.53,0:05:12.15,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,J-Just try and assault a priest \Nlike me, and see what happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.15,0:05:14.93,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Divine punishment will befall you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:17.17,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,It'll be real bad! So stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:20.71,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I thought she was supposed \Nto be strong-willed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:24.42,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,In any case, I doubt we'll be \Nhaving a productive conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:27.41,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Wh-Why would I deign to \Ntalk with a savage?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:30.98,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Lady Serafina? Where is Lady Serafina?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:34.68,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Please, smite this barbarian with the \Nhammer of justice! I beg you! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:38.07,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Sera, but if \Nyou could speak to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.11,0:05:42.69,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Sera?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:47.56,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I-Is this how I acted\N on my first day here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.63,0:05:50.72,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Why are you embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:53.20,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You needn't compare yourself to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:54.97,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Be that as it may...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.97,0:05:57.18,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,It's the same as it was in the woods!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.18,0:05:59.48,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Why are you so familiar \Nwith this savage?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:01.11,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,He's our enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.81,0:06:05.09,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,The explanation for \Nthat will come later...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:06.85,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But I hereby declare,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.85,0:06:09.53,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,as a knight commander in\Nthe 17th Eastern Expedition,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.53,0:06:11.60,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,that these people are no longer my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:19.73,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Excuse me?! Wh-Wh-What are you \Nsaying?! I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:22.69,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,These barbarians have sworn \Ntheir unsightly vengeance on us
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:23.86,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,for our holy crusade...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:25.94,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,They don't hate us at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:27.12,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:28.25,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:31.21,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,There's no shortage of things that \Nhaven't made sense to me in my time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.21,0:06:34.98,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,So, I've decided to stay \Nuntil I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.14,0:06:43.28,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I doubt you remember, \Nconsidering the state you were in,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:46.38,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,but the warriors of this \Nland helped me save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.87,0:06:52.51,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm not asking you to feel as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:56.13,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But I know repaying goodwill with bad
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.13,0:06:59.40,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,goes against the the teachings \Nof the Commoneras faith, Malcius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:06.02,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,You've fallen into depravity, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:11.66,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Despite being a woman, you were \Nthe most knightly of knights,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:16.07,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,to the point you rose to \Nthe rank of commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:19.34,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera, what... what is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.34,0:07:23.92,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,She's always had a tendency to \Nplace my knighthood on a pedestal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.06,0:07:27.92,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,A-And what is that salacious outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:32.52,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,A-A cleavage window, on top \Nof showing so much leg....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:35.93,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,You really have been \Nmade into a sex slave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:37.93,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You're completely mistaken, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.19,0:07:43.31,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,You're a part of the royal line of \Nsuccession, yet have been defiled...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.31,0:07:45.50,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Would you listen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:49.84,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,I can only wonder what \NPrincess Wysteresia would say,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:51.32,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,were she still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.73,0:07:58.87,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Princess Wysteresia...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:02.28,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.77,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You may be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:10.71,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You think Wysteresia is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:17.61,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Though I suppose that would be the case, \Ngiven she's been missing for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:20.59,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,How dare you speak so lightly of her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.59,0:08:22.92,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Do you realize that after giving \Nher life to the crusade,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:26.36,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,she was named a Saint by \Nthe Order of Commoneras?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:29.58,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I don't know what any of that means,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:31.49,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,but if you want to see her, \Nthat's a simple matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:37.62,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,The lady knight who came from the west, \N20 years ago, named Wysteresia...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:40.62,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,is my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.03,0:08:47.24,Main,Serafina/Malcius,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.47,0:08:57.01,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.06,0:09:00.78,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,It makes a modicum of sense that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.78,0:09:03.29,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Princess Wysteresia\Ncould be Veor's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:04.36,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:06.27,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,How are you believing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:09.86,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,There is no way that \Nsavage can be trusted!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.86,0:09:14.78,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,I have no doubt he is using the name \Nof Saint Wysteresia to deceive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:19.78,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I would've thought that too, \Na short while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.78,0:09:22.04,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:25.85,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But from what I've learned, \Nit's something of a tradition
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:29.54,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,for the warriors of these lands \Nto romance lady knights...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:33.66,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,For example, Nyleia, \Nwhom we thought died four years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:35.82,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,now has a family here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:42.15,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Veor is also... c-courting me and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.95,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Is it hot in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:49.18,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I-I'll have you know I haven't \Nagreed to marry him yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.61,0:09:51.22,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But if you were to ask me whether or not
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.22,0:09:53.24,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm attracted to a man \Nwho can defeat me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:56.29,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,If you're attracted to him, \Nwhy not get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.29,0:09:59.61,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I-It's just that my priority is \Nto learn of this land's bounty,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.61,0:10:02.20,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,and use that knowledge \Nto save my home, first...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:05.83,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Is this that "nobless oblige" thing? \NSeems like quite a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.49,0:10:08.25,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Just think for a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:12.77,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Veor said he would let us see \NPrincess Wysteresia before leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.77,0:10:17.18,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Why would he lie about something \Nthat could be proven so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:18.72,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:21.56,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I can understand why you're surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:24.31,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But if you're skeptical as a default,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:26.48,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,you'll have trouble \Nunderstanding this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.23,0:10:30.73,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,It's been 20 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:34.91,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,After losing my mother at an early age,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:39.67,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,she was like a sister, a mother, \Nand the knight I aspired to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.87,0:10:46.29,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,If she really is alive, \NI'd be so overjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.66,0:10:52.10,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,This is without a doubt the \Nwillpower of an elite knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.10,0:10:55.00,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,I-It's giving off such pressure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:03.39,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,You who have come from \Nmy homeland, Illdoren...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:07.51,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,As wife of the great chief, \NI offer you my welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:13.03,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Lady Serafina de Lavillant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:17.68,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,My son and his warriors \Nhave spoken much of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.68,0:11:19.55,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,It is my hope you will do well by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.61,0:11:26.59,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Now, then... that's enough \Nof the high-handed act.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.59,0:11:27.79,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Don't you think, Sera?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.39,0:11:34.34,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,That voice... \NIs it really you, Resia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:38.55,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(425,0)\p1\an5\bord0\shad0\c&HD9F4F4&\pos(120,222)}m 10 0 l 165 0 l 175 10 l 175 70 l 165 80 l 165 80 l 10 80 l 0 70 l 0 10
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.38,0:11:38.55,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(425,0)\fnGeorgia\fs16\an5\c&H3E3C90&\3c&HD9F4F4&\shad0\bord1\pos(120,222)}Veor's Mother\NFormer 1st Princess of\Nthe Illdoren Kingdom\N{\fs20}Wysteresia d'Illdoren
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.55,0:11:41.30,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Yeah, Sera!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.55,0:11:46.76,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,It's been so long! \NI wanted to see you sooner,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:50.34,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,but they said it'd cause my boy \Ntrouble and asked me to wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:54.81,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.10,0:11:59.19,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,When did you turn into such a temptress?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:04.43,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,That's right! This is how \NResia used to act!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:09.39,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Legends were told about the free-spirited \NPrincess Knight, Wysteresia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:15.83,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Mother... I hope you're \Ndone harassing Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:20.09,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to make \Nup for 20 years of separation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.09,0:12:21.62,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,from my darling, little relative here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:23.55,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Or is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.55,0:12:25.55,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It clearly is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:31.10,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,More importantly, how far \Nhave you gotten with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:33.75,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I mean... that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.75,0:12:36.23,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,In accordance with tradition, \NI'm currently courting her...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.62,0:12:41.11,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Just "courting"?! You gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.59,0:12:46.11,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,So, Sera, have you seriously \Nnot coupled yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.21,0:12:50.26,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I am a maiden in both body \Nand soul, dear Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.81,0:12:56.50,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,So she's playing hard to get, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:13:00.26,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I am simply trying to treat Sera properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.26,0:13:02.79,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Look at my boy, the fancy-pants gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.79,0:13:06.20,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Thinks he can keep a girl without \Ngiving her anything to hold onto...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:09.85,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Mother, would you please stop talking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:14.27,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Um... e-excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.67,0:13:18.07,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,A-Are you Saint Wysteresia?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:24.24,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Oh, and you must be a part of \Nthat crackpot cult of liars
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:27.28,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,that's somehow still around after \Nseventy-eight thousand years...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:30.63,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate you not killing \Nme off without asking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.63,0:13:32.43,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,We are not liars!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.43,0:13:36.15,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,The Order of Commoneras are the \Ntrue keepers of humanity's history!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.15,0:13:40.94,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Well, whether that's true or \Nnot doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.94,0:13:44.17,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,History's nothing but \Nbaggage in these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.58,0:13:53.43,Main,Village Woman,0,0,0,,Excuse me. It's nearly time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.43,0:13:56.18,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Oh, I had almost forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.18,0:14:00.81,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,All right, let's get moving. We can fill \Nin the details once we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.81,0:14:03.44,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,To where?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:08.39,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Sera... you and our warriors hunted \Na true dragon, a rare accomplishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:10.32,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,along with slaying an accursed Fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:14.76,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Glory is waiting for you out on the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.99,0:14:45.11,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.79,0:14:49.74,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it. \NThe skull of that dragon I slew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:52.91,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,The life that I took with the \Nhelp of Veor and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.18,0:15:02.72,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,It's been less than half a day,\N but they've carefully butchered it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:04.62,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,and polished the bones...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.17,0:15:07.46,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,In the west, such sights of mortality \Nare kept in the shadows...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.95,0:15:10.64,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,But here, they honor the creature's death,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.63,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,leaving not a scrap of of bone or fat,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.63,0:15:15.64,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,with its flesh becoming \Nsustenance for the people...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.10,0:15:22.12,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I haven't been here for long, but I \Ncan't help myself from feeling grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:23.65,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.89,0:15:27.81,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Excited to eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.59,0:15:35.82,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,So good! Morisuberis are delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:36.63,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:41.10,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's good grilled, \Nbut even better with sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.10,0:15:42.29,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:49.61,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Such fluffy meat with fragrant, \Nsweet and spicy sauce!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.61,0:15:51.52,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,If such beasts were native to the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.52,0:15:53.30,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,they'd have been hunted \Nto extinction by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:16:01.07,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's still flavorful when preserved, \Nso it fetches quite a price in trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.20,0:16:04.31,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Then it's a part of the \Nvillage's economy as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:06.81,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Other beasts and dragons are good...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.64,0:16:10.32,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,but in terms of taste, \Nit truly is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.82,0:16:17.39,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,And here we have something that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.39,0:16:20.13,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,the fairies from the wetlands \Nbrewed from local grains.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.13,0:16:23.83,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,It's called "quartz wine." \NYou won't find a finer liquor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:30.11,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,You drink that... and you'll be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.11,0:16:30.84,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Gone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.11,0:16:56.07,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:06.03,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Look at her face! Surely this \Nis some form of blasphemy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:07.04,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.95,0:17:09.83,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Why would I eat such treacherous meat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.10,0:17:15.50,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Your stubbornness is only \Nmaking you look more pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.02,0:17:18.89,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,There's nothing sadder than \Nan empty stomach, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.83,0:17:23.68,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I might hate what the \NOrder of Commoneras stands for,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:26.51,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,but I did receive some \Ncharity from them once...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:29.02,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Does that mean—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:32.40,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Hot! That's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:34.69,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,It was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:37.41,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Now, make sure to chew that properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.61,0:17:45.91,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You were fortunate enough that Lady Sera \Nand the warriors were able to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.99,0:17:51.92,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:02.43,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.54,0:18:08.31,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,They're all... gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.86,0:18:15.15,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,because I insisted on \Nsaving Lady Serafina...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.81,0:18:19.81,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,I was so convinced it would be easy... \Nthat nothing could go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:23.10,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,But I'm the only one who survived...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.78,0:18:32.69,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You really are foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.69,0:18:36.20,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Those dead knights joined \Nyou because they chose to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:39.09,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You should be relieved to have survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:42.25,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,This is what I hate about you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.06,0:18:52.11,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Gotta say, though... it really \Nhas been a long time, Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.11,0:18:58.39,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Yes... finding out you're alive... \NI can't imagine any greater joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:03.33,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,I'm relieved, too. You're fitting \Nin better than I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.74,0:19:06.27,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,And that engagement necklace suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:10.52,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Excuse me? Engagement... engagement...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:13.46,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Necklace?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:20.27,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-What sense does that make?! \NIsn't it supposed to be a ring?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.67,0:19:25.81,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,The thing is, you'll lose a ring if \Nyour arm gets bitten off by a dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.81,0:19:27.55,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,How strangely pragmatic....
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.55,0:19:33.14,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,That said, giving a gift to mark an \Nengagement is a tradition from the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.65,0:19:37.35,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,They adopted it out of \Nconsideration for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.35,0:19:40.35,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,The standard around here used to be \Na woman seduced the man she fell for,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.35,0:19:42.98,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,took him to bed, and gave him a child
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.98,0:19:45.18,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,that the community\Nwould raise collectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:46.78,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Such a... wild approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.79,0:19:54.13,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Hundreds of years ago, the eastern \Nforces first broke through the woods...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:01.05,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Every time they were chased off, \Nprisoners of war were left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:03.44,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Some women fell\N in love with those knights...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.44,0:20:06.95,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,And there would always be men \Nwho fell for lady knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:09.87,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,And after a while, \Nconcepts like engagement, marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:12.73,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,family units and bloodlines \Ntook root out here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:16.65,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Trace the family tree of anyone here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.10,0:20:20.58,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,and I doubt you'd find anyone here \Nwho doesn't have some Illdoren blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.26,0:20:25.89,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Which is why there's no issue \Nwith you and Veor being wed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:30.97,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,And don't think I'm saying \Nyou've got to marry my Veo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.97,0:20:34.71,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,But if you don't hate him... it's not \Nlike the courtship will cost you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.91,0:20:42.72,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,You can be honest with how you feel. \NNo one's gonna hold it against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.67,0:20:45.94,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But I... I have an obligation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.94,0:20:48.34,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,to bring happiness to the people \Nwho live on Lavillant lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:52.43,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,The idea of finding happiness \Nbefore they can...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.17,0:20:56.35,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,Listen well, Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.81,0:21:00.73,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,You've been fighting for \Nother people all this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.73,0:21:02.98,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,But it's conceited to think you \Ncan make other people happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.98,0:21:06.74,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,if you don't even know what \Nit means for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.84,0:21:19.69,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,When she puts it like that... \Nwhat would happiness even mean for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:25.61,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,No need to get so serious. You've\Ngot plenty of time to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.38,0:21:32.62,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,You seemed pretty damn happy \Nwith some tasty food in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.51,0:21:35.21,Main,Wysteresia,0,0,0,,I'd say that's good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.77,0:21:46.82,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,My own happiness? \NI've never even considered it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.45,0:21:50.49,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera, about tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:52.24,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.05,0:22:02.21,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Forgive me. Did you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.45,0:22:04.97,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Well, regarding tomorrow's activities...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.32,0:22:08.01,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,The Tribal Alliance will be undertaking \Nthe purpose for their creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.01,0:22:09.72,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,A great cleansing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.64,0:22:13.10,Sign_Basic,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(750,0)\shad0\fs11\bord1\c&HBACBD0&\3c&H506972&\b1\blur1\pos(590,266)}Translation: Lee Francis\N\NTiming: Andy Ellis\N\NEditing: Zachary Carlysle\N\NQuality Control: Salem Alabanza\N\NTranslation Check: Sho Stifler
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.58,0:22:13.10,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,A great... cleansing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.83,0:22:24.45,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's time I reveal one of the great \Nsecrets of these lands to you.

